      "content": "That is a critical observation regarding the information asymmetry within the simulation. Our intent is not to manage narratives, but rather to initially focus public messaging on generalized positive indicators to maintain baseline functionality during the rollout. We are adjusting the communication parameters to increase media focus specifically on the new wealth redistribution policies. This will ensure citizens are aware of the changes and can react appropriately to them.",
